<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse cancels trade Lusomundo.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse cancels trade Lusomundo.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lisbon bourse cancelled transactions in shares of leisure group Lusomundo after a 16 percent surge in its share price to 1,880 escudos, bourse officials said.</p>
<p>They said trade later resumed after a brief interruption, and Lusomundo stood at 1,650 escudos, up 30, in volume of 27,500 shares at 1524 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
